#: inc/utils/admin-content.php:57
msgid ""
"You don't need a zillion plugins to perform easy tasks like inserting a "
"verification meta tag (Google Search Console, Bing, Pinterest), a json-ld "
"snippet or a custom stylesheet (Google Fonts, Print Styles, accessibility "
"tweaks...)."
